  "title": "Artivion Completes Acquisition of Endospan Ltd.",
  "summary": "ATLANTA, May 18, 2026 Artivion, Inc. (NYSE: AORT), a leading cardiac and vascular surgery company focused on aortic disease, today announced that it has completed the acquisition of its long-standing partner Endospan Ltd. (\"Endospan\"), a pioneer in the endovascular repair of aortic arch disease",
